 "nodes": [
  {
   "ref": "81",
   "text": "one would have to set him well apart,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "82",
   "text": "for Alexander was a heathen."
  },
  {
   "ref": "83",
   "text": "Many liars still say"
  },
  {
   "ref": "84",
   "text": "that he was the son of a conjurer —"
  },
  {
   "ref": "85",
   "text": "Alexander, of whom I am telling you."
  },
  {
   "ref": "86",
   "text": "They lie like base cowards,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "87",
   "text": "all who ever thought it,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "88",
   "text": "for he was truly of royal lineage."
  },
  {
   "ref": "89",
   "text": "Such lying tales"
  },
  {
   "ref": "90",
   "text": "should count for nothing."
  },
  {
   "ref": "5242",
   "text": "how it went with the ladies,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5243",
   "text": "where they came from,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5244",
   "text": "or what end they came to —"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5245",
   "text": "at that you may well, each of you,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5246",
   "text": "be greatly amazed."
  },
  {
   "ref": "5260",
   "text": "and closed tight all over;"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5261",
   "text": "they were wondrously large."
  },
  {
   "ref": "5262",
   "text": "When the flower opened at the top —"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5263",
   "text": "mark this in your minds —"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5264",
   "text": "then inside it there were"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5265",
   "text": "maidens, perfectly formed."
  },
  {
   "ref": "5266",
   "text": "I tell you as I have heard it:"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5267",
   "text": "they walked and lived,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5341",
   "text": "When the time had run its course,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5342",
   "text": "our joy came to an end:"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5343",
   "text": "the flowers perished entirely"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5344",
   "text": "and the beautiful ladies died;"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5345",
   "text": "the trees let fall their leaves,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5346",
   "text": "and the springs their flowing,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5614",
   "text": "He questioned him, saying"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5615",
   "text": "what his business was."
  },
  {
   "ref": "5616",
   "text": "Then the young lord said,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5617",
   "text": "“Candace is my mother."
  },
  {
   "ref": "5618",
   "text": "Hear, of your goodness,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "5619",
   "text": "the heart's grief that I lament to you."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6306",
   "text": "both the young lords"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6307",
   "text": "reached for their shields."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6308",
   "text": "Then spoke the gracious lady,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6309",
   "text": "Candace the queen,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6310",
   "text": "with great wisdom,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6311",
   "text": "to me in secret:"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6312",
   "text": "“Alexander, mighty hero,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6313",
   "text": "you must, for my sake,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6314",
   "text": "let it be seen today"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6464",
   "text": "for they were glad to see me."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6465",
   "text": "From there we went on"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6466",
   "text": "through mountains that were high,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6467",
   "text": "and pitched our tents"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6468",
   "text": "on a broad field,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6469",
   "text": "and I had letters written"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6470",
   "text": "to the women of war"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6471",
   "text": "who are called Amazons;"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6472",
   "text": "Amazonia was the name of their land."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6473",
   "text": "I sent their queen"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6474",
   "text": "my gracious love"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6475",
   "text": "in my letter"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6608",
   "text": "over many a mighty king,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6609",
   "text": "who all honoured him"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6610",
   "text": "and increased his praise"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6611",
   "text": "and sent him tribute,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6612",
   "text": "all of them, from their lands —"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6613",
   "text": "none of this seemed enough to him."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6614",
   "text": "His pride carried him so far"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6615",
   "text": "that he had himself guided"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6616",
   "text": "toward Paradise;"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6617",
   "text": "he wanted to conquer it"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6618",
   "text": "and bring tribute from there too,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6619",
   "text": "from the angelic choirs."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6620",
   "text": "Here you may hear of folly:"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6621",
   "text": "how he set about it."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6729",
   "text": "they came to a river,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6730",
   "text": "great and wide;"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6731",
   "text": "it was called Euphrates."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6732",
   "text": "The people he found there,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6733",
   "text": "both small and great,"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6734",
   "text": "told him that it flowed"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6735",
   "text": "out of Paradise."
  },
  {
   "ref": "6736",
   "text": "Then he ordered that with provisions"
  },
  {
   "ref": "6737",
   "text": "his ships be fitted out."
  }
 ]
}